WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.461
Water is moving on a street in this practice scene.

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:06.787
Do not walk, swim, or drive through flood waters.

00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:07.987
Turn around.

00:00:07.987 --> 00:00:09.187
Don’t drown.

00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:12.216
Six inches of fast-moving water can knock a person down.
